Rem -->KEY TO THE SPECIES

1,5$ Type
1,2 $ . Stipe smooth, caulocystidia absent; spores ellipsoid or ovoid.
1,3 $ . Stipe pruinose, caulocystidia present; spores ovoid or mitriform.
2,0 $ Pileus rather pale ochre-brown $ C. truncorum
2,0 $ Pileus usually real ochre-brown, rust $ C. saccharinus
3,0 $ Pleurocystidia abundant, oblong; spores ovoid $ C. pallidissimus
3,4 $ . Pleurocystidia absent or very scarce and then only near lamellae-edge; spores ovoid or (sub)mitriform.
